**`src/lib.rs`** — added `filter_by_tag` (lines 43–46):
```rust
pub fn filter_by_tag<'a>(notes: &'a [Note], tag: &str) -> Vec<&'a Note> {
    notes.iter().filter(|n| n.tags.iter().any(|t| t == tag)).collect()
}
```

**`src/main.rs`** — the `list` command now accepts `--tag <TAG>` as args[2]/args[3]. When present, output is filtered through `filter_by_tag`; otherwise it prints all notes as before.


